   "id": "204e0418fe05182f8f8b3a15c1c5b627839033c4",
   "message": "fix(study): compare reference caps structurally at the pinned converter\n\nAttempt F refused 442 bit-exact NVDEC frames because the NV12 caps were read\nbefore the pinned capsfilter and caps strings were compared field-order\nsensitively. Observe NV12 caps at the single pinned videoconvert sink, strip\nonly GStreamer default multiview fields, require gst_caps_is_equal with the\npinned caps, and retain actual caps SHA per frame plus text in stderr.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
